atural",80.18,80.58]]},{"start":80.58,"end":85.16,"text":"rubber was produced on small holdings, and in case you're not familiar with the","words":[["rubber",80.58,80.88],["was",80.88,81.26],["produced",81.26,81.62],["on",81.62,81.98],["small",81.98,82.36],["holdings,",82.36,82.92],["and",83.3,83.54],["in",83.54,83.74],["case",83.74,83.96],["you're",83.96,84.22],["not",84.22,84.34],["familiar",84.34,84.76],["with",84.76,85.06],["the",85.06,85.16]]},{"start":85.16,"end":90.36,"text":"process, I'll just describe it briefly. The first stage in the process, known as","words":[["process,",85.16,85.54],["I'll",86.0,86.16],["just",86.16,86.34],["describe",86.34,86.76],["it",86.76,86.9],["briefly.",86.9,87.22],["The",88.08,88.34],["first",88.34,88.58],["stage",88.58,88.94],["in",88.94,89.1],["the",89.1,89.16],["process,",89.16,89.58],["known",89.92,90.14],["as",90.14,90.36]]},{"start":90.36,"end":95.0,"text":"tapping, involves making an incision in the rubber tree and removing a thin layer","words":[["tapping,",90.36,90.66],["involves",91.22,91.64],["making",91.64,92.06],["an",92.06,92.28],["incision",92.28,92.68],["in",92.68,92.86],["the",92.86,92.94],["rubber",92.94,93.14],["tree",93.14,93.48],["and",93.48,93.92],["removing",93.92,94.22],["a",94.22,94.5],["thin",94.5,94.76],["layer",94.76,95.0]]},{"start":95.0,"end":99.98,"text":"of bark. This procedure has to be done very carefully with a special knife,","words":[["of",95.0,95.24],["bark.",95.24,95.52],["This",96.46,96.78],["procedure",96.78,97.26],["has",97.26,97.52],["to",97.52,97.64],["be",97.64,97.76],["done",97.76,97.98],["very",97.98,98.22],["carefully",98.22,98.7],["with",98.7,99.16],["a",99.16,99.26],["special",99.26,99.62],["knife,",99.62,99.98]]},{"start":100.3,"end":105.4,"text":"because if the incision is too deep, the tree will be damaged. And a white","words":[["because",100.3,100.72],["if",100.72,100.96],["the",100.96,101.14],["incision",101.14,101.62],["is",101.62,101.84],["too",101.84,102.02],["deep,",102.02,102.42],["the",102.78,102.94],["tree",102.94,103.22],["will",103.22,103.38],["be",103.38,103.52],["damaged.",103.52,103.86],["And",104.72,105.06],["a",105.06,105.16],["white",105.16,105.4]]},{"start":105.4,"end":107.96,"text":"liquid known as latex starts to ooze out.","words":[["liquid",105.4,105.72],["known",105.72,106.04],["as",106.04,106.24],["latex",106.24,106.8],["starts",106.8,107.28],["to",107.28,107.54],["ooze",107.54,107.78],["out.",107.78,107.96]]},{"start":108.98,"end":114.3,"text":"Next, the tapper attaches a cup to the tree, made out of something simple like a coconut","words":[["Next,",108.98,109.34],["the",109.7,109.8],["tapper",109.8,110.12],["attaches",110.12,110.48],["a",110.48,110.84],["cup",110.84,111.12],["to",111.12,111.32],["the",111.32,111.44],["tree,",111.44,111.78],["made",112.28,112.46],["out",112.46,112.66],["of",112.66,112.76],["something",112.76,113.02],["simple",113.02,113.56],["like",113.56,113.9],["a",113.9,114.02],["coconut",114.02,114.3]]},{"start":114.3,"end":115.86,"text":"shell to collect it.","words":[["shell",114.3,114.8],["to",114.8,115.26],["collect",115.26,115.62],["it.",115.62,115.86]]},{"start":116.8,"end":122.22,"text":"Tapping is usually started in the early morning, because the coolness encourages the latex","words":[["Tapping",116.8,117.18],["is",117.18,117.72],["usually",117.72,118.08],["started",118.08,118.52],["in",118.52,118.82],["the",118.82,118.94],["early",118.94,119.2],["morning,",119.2,119.54],["because",119.92,120.32],["the",120.32,120.5],["coolness",120.5,120.94],["encourages",120.94,121.38],["the",121.38,121.76],["latex",121.76,122.22]]},{"start":122.22,"end":123.02,"text":"to flow easily.","words":[["to",122.22,122.36],["flow",122.36,122.58],["easily.",122.58,123.02]]},{"start":124.4,"end":129.58,"text":"Later in the day, the tapper goes back to each tree to get the latex, and take it","words":[["Later",124.4,124.84],["in",124.84,125.06],["the",125.06,125.14],["day,",125.14,125.42],["the",125.8,125.96],["tapper",125.96,126.22],["goes",126.22,126.48],["back",126.48,126.74],["to",126.74,126.94],["each",126.94,127.2],["tree",127.2,127.54],["to",127.54,127.7],["get",127.7,127.86],["the",127.86,128.02],["latex,",128.02,128.52],["and",128.7,129.14],["take",129.14,129.4],["it",129.4,129.58]]},{"start":129.58,"end":135.16,"text":"to what you might call the factory, although the procedures that take place in it are","words":[["to",129.58,129.76],["what",129.76,129.94],["you",129.94,130.12],["might",130.12,130.3],["call",130.3,130.68],["the",130.68,131.02],["factory,",131.02,131.56],["although",132.16,132.62],["the",132.62,133.02],["procedures",133.02,133.54],["that",133.54,133.92],["take",133.92,134.14],["place",134.14,134.4],["in",134.4,134.6],["it",134.6,134.76],["are",134.76,135.16]]},{"start":135.16,"end":142.0,"text":"relatively simple. Here it is poured into a mold and then formic acid is added to","words":[["relatively",135.16,135.5],["simple.",135.5,136.04],["Here",136.94,137.4],["it",137.4,137.9],["is",137.9,138.02],["poured",138.02,138.34],["into",138.34,138.64],["a",138.64,138.82],["mold",138.82,139.24],["and",139.24,140.02],["then",140.02,140.28],["formic",140.28,140.94],["acid",140.94,141.32],["is",141.32,141.54],["added",141.54,141.74],["to",141.74,142.0]]},{"start":142.0,"end":147.78,"text":"it and the mixtures left for a few hours. The purpose of the formic acid is to","words":[["it",142.0,142.18],["and",142.18,142.86],["the",142.86,142.98],["mixtures",142.98,143.3],["left",143.3,143.72],["for",143.72,144.0],["a",144.0,144.14],["few",144.14,144.28],["hours.",144.28,144.64],["The",145.48,145.8],["purpose",145.8,146.16],["of",146.16,146.34],["the",146.34,146.46],["formic",146.46,146.82],["acid",146.82,147.2],["is",147.2,147.62],["to",147.62,147.78]]},{"start":147.78,"end":153.36,"text":"thicken the liquid latex. So after some time the latex is transformed into a","words":[["thicken",147.78,148.12],["the",148.12,148.34],["liquid",148.34,148.6],["latex.",148.6,149.18],["So",149.82,150.28],["after",150.28,150.64],["some",150.64,150.92],["time",150.92,151.28],["the",151.28,151.66],["latex",151.66,152.12],["is",152.12,152.26],["transformed",152.26,152.72],["into",152.72,153.14],["a",153.14,153.36]]},{"start":153.36,"end":159.84,"text":"solid block of rubber. This block of rubber is then pressed manually to turn","words":[["solid",153.36,153.72],["block",153.72,154.08],["of",154.08,154.36],["rubber.",154.36,154.62],["This",155.68,156.4],["block",156.4,156.7],["of",156.7,156.9],["rubber",156.9,157.14],["is",157.14,157.6],["then",157.6,157.78],["pressed",157.78,158.24],["manually",158.24,158.88],["to",158.88,159.6],["turn",159.6,159.84]]},{"start":159.84,"end":160.96,"text":"it into a thin sheet.","words":[["it",159.84,159.98],["into",159.98,160.2],["a",160.2,160.4],["thin",160.4,160.6],["sheet.",160.6,160.96]]},{"start":161.82,"end":166.32,"text":"And then, when it's thin enough, the rubber sheet is fed through a mangle.","words":[["And",161.82,162.08],["then,",162.08,162.38],["when",162.7,162.86],["it's",162.86,163.04],["thin",163.04,163.22],["enough,",163.22,163.44],["the",164.0,164.18],["rubber",164.18,164.38],["sheet",164.38,164.76],["is",164.76,165.24],["fed",165.24,165.54],["through",165.54,165.82],["a",165.82,165.92],["mangle.",165.92,166.32]]},{"start":167.16,"end":172.44,"text":"And I should point out that apart from this, no other machinery is used in the process.","words":[["And",167.16,167.66],["I",167.66,167.88],["should",167.88,168.04],["point",168.04,168.3],["out",168.3,168.62],["that",168.62,168.88],["apart",168.88,169.22],["from",169.22,169.5],["this,",169.5,169.8],["no",170.06,170.24],["other",170.24,170.62],["machinery",170.62,171.14],["is",171.14,171.5],["used",171.5,171.78],["in",171.78,171.94],["the",171.94,172.02],["process.",172.02,172.44]]},{"start":173.32,"end":178.24,"text":"It's fairly simple, just a frame with two rollers and a handle to turn them.","words":[["It's",173.32,173.66],["fairly",173.66,173.92],["simple,",173.92,174.36],["just",174.84,175.08],["a",175.08,175.28],["frame",175.28,175.64],["with",175.64,175.98],["two",175.98,176.22],["rollers",176.22,176.58],["and",176.58,177.16],["a",177.16,177.32],["handle",177.32,177.58],["to",177.58,177.8],["turn",177.8,178.06],["them.",178.06,178.24]]},{"start":178.98,"end":183.96,"text":"The procedure is repeated several times to get rid of as much water as possible.","words":[["The",178.98,179.24],["procedure",179.24,179.66],["is",179.66,180.24],["repeated",180.24,180.64],["several",180.64,181.02],["times",181.02,181.46],["to",181.46,181.9],["get",181.9,182.12],["rid",182.12,182.34],["of",182.34,182.54],["as",182.54,182.66],["much",182.66,182.94],["water",182.94,183.32],["as",183.32,183.5],["possible.",183.5,183.96]]},{"start":183.96,"end":189.18,"text":"And finally, these sheets are taken to a special smoke room where they are dried.","words":[["And",183.96,184.9],["finally,",184.9,185.32],["these",185.66,185.84],["sheets",185.84,186.08],["are",186.08,186.3],["taken",186.3,186.58],["to",186.58,186.86],["a",186.86,187.0],["special",187.0,187.34],["smoke",187.34,187.66],["room",187.66,188.02],["where",188.02,188.5],["they",188.5,188.68],["are",188.68,188.78],["dried.",188.78,189.18]]},{"start":190.86,"end":194.64,"text":"And you're then left with, what are by now, sheets of brown rubber.","words":[["And",190.86,191.08],["you're",191.08,191.28],["then",191.28,191.38],["left",191.38,191.68],["with,",191.68,191.96],["what",192.18,192.44],["are",192.44,192.58],["by",192.58,192.74],["now,",192.74,193.02],["sheets",193.28,193.52],["of",193.52,193.9],["brown",193.9,194.32],["rubber.",194.32,194.64]]},{"start":195.68,"end":201.3,"text":"These are then sold to traders, who collect them from villages and sell them on in turn.","words":[["These",195.68,196.16],["are",196.16,196.44],["then",196.44,196.64],["sold",196.64,196.94],["to",196.94,197.14],["traders,",197.14,197.58],["who",198.2,198.44],["collect",198.44,198.78],["them",198.78,199.02],["from",199.02,199.22],["villages",199.22,199.62],["and",199.62,200.2],["sell",200.2,200.48],["them",200.48,200.62],["on",200.62,200.82],["in",200.82,201.04],["turn.",201.04,201.3]]},{"start":206.79,"end":208.25,"text":"Well, that's the process then.","words":[["Well,",206.79,207.11],["that's",207.19,207.41],["the",207.41,207.51],["process",207.51,207.91],["then.",207.91,208.25]]},{"start":208.67,"end":211.49,"text":"Now just a little bit about the history of rubber.","words":[["Now",208.67,209.01],["just",209.01,209.49],["a",209.49,209.73],["little",209.73,209.95],["bit",209.95,210.15],["about",210.15,210.41],["the",210.41,210.63],["history",210.63,211.01],["of",211.01,211.27],["rubber.",211.27,211.49]]},{"start":212.25,"end":217.21,"text":"Rubber was in use in America long before it became commercially important.","words":[["Rubber",212.25,212.81],["was",212.81,213.07],["in",213.07,213.41],["use",213.41,213.75],["in",213.75,214.11],["America",214.11,214.49],["long",214.49,215.01],["before",215.01,215.37],["it",215.37,215.59],["became",215.59,215.95],["commercially",215.95,216.57],["important.",216.57,217.21]]},{"start":217.21,"end":225.73,"text":"The rubber tree was a native of Brazil and there's an account from as long ago as 1525 of people in","words":[["The",217.21,218.15],["rubber",218.15,218.43],["tree",218.43,218.81],["was",218.81,219.15],["a",219.15,219.31],["native",219.31,219.51],["of",219.51,219.75],["Brazil",219.75,220.09],["and",220.09,220.97],["there's",220.97,221.19],["an",221.19,221.29],["account",221.29,221.73],["from",221.73,222.25],["as",222.25,222.37],["long",222.37,222.65],["ago",222.65,223.01],["as",223.01,223.25],["1525",223.25,224.37],["of",224.37,225.21],["people",225.21,225.53],["in",225.53,225.73]]},{"start":225.73,"end":233.27,"text":"Mexico playing with rubber balls. But it wasn't until the 19th century that Europeans recognized","words":[["Mexico",225.73,226.19],["playing",226.19,226.89],["with",226.89,227.11],["rubber",227.11,227.39],["balls.",227.39,227.95],["But",228.57,229.29],["it",229.29,229.43],["wasn't",229.43,229.81],["until",229.81,230.13],["the",230.13,230.29],["19th",230.29,230.85],["century",230.85,231.21],["that",231.21,231.73],["Europeans",231.73,232.23],["recognized",232.23,233.27]]},{"start":233.27,"end":239.37,"text":"the usefulness of the substance chiefly for clothing. Various attempts were made to","words":[["the",233.27,233.67],["usefulness",233.67,234.27],["of",234.27,234.41],["the",234.41,234.53],["substance",234.53,234.93],["chiefly",234.93,235.77],["for",235.77,236.01],["clothing.",236.01,236.41],["Various",237.41,238.13],["attempts",238.13,238.55],["were",238.55,238.95],["made",238.95,239.19],["to",239.19,239.37]]},{"start":239.37,"end":245.07,"text":"improve the properties of rubber. One of the key discoveries was of a process known","words":[["improve",239.37,239.77],["the",239.77,239.99],["properties",239.99,240.51],["of",240.51,240.79],["rubber.",240.79,241.07],["One",241.95,242.25],["of",242.25,242.37],["the",242.37,242.47],["key",242.47,242.69],["discoveries",242.69,243.19],["was",243.19,243.93],["of",243.93,244.15],["a",244.15,244.23],["process",244.23,244.67],["known",244.67,245.07]]},{"start":245.07,"end":250.49,"text":"as vulcanization, which involved heating the rubber and adding sulfur to it.","words":[["as",245.07,245.31],["vulcanization,",245.31,246.55],["which",247.19,247.43],["involved",247.43,247.91],["heating",247.91,248.21],["the",248.21,248.45],["rubber",248.45,248.65],["and",248.65,249.17],["adding",249.17,249.53],["sulfur",249.53,249.93],["to",249.93,250.27],["it.",250.27,250.49]]},{"start":251.23,"end":257.37,"text":"And the result was a substance that had a lot more strength and was also more elastic, making","words":[["And",251.23,251.43],["the",251.43,251.53],["result",251.53,251.85],["was",251.85,252.29],["a",252.29,252.45],["substance",252.45,252.79],["that",252.79,253.37],["had",253.37,253.55],["a",253.55,253.67],["lot",253.67,253.93],["more",253.93,254.11],["strength",254.11,254.63],["and",254.63,255.25],["was",255.25,255.43],["also",255.43,255.71],["more",255.71,255.93],["elastic,",255.93,256.43],["making",256.99,257.37]]},{"start":257.37,"end":259.39,"text":"it suitable for a variety of uses.","words":[["it",257.37,257.59],["suitable",257.59,257.87],["for",257.87,258.23],["a",258.23,258.41],["variety",258.41,258.83],["of",258.83,259.11],["uses.",259.11,259.39]]},{"start":260.21,"end":265.65,"text":"But the thing that gave demand for rubber a real boost was the expanding automobile","words":[["But",260.21,260.75],["the",260.75,260.87],["thing",260.87,261.11],["that",261.11,261.29],["gave",261.29,261.57],["demand",261.57,261.87],["for",261.87,262.23],["rubber",262.23,262.53],["a",262.53,262.77],["real",262.77,263.09],["boost",263.09,263.45],["was",263.45,264.09],["the",264.09,264.27],["expanding",264.27,264.91],["automobile",264.91,265.65]]},{"start":265.65,"end":272.01,"text":"industry at the end of the 19th century and the invention of car tires.","words":[["industry",265.65,266.43],["at",266.43,267.11],["the",267.11,267.25],["end",267.25,267.55],["of",267.55,267.73],["the",267.73,267.85],["19th",267.85,268.87],["century",268.87,268.87],["and",268.87,269.65],["the",269.65,269.91],["invention",269.91,270.43],["of",270.43,271.03],["car",271.03,271.43],["tires.",271.43,272.01]]},{"start":272.91,"end":279.79,"text":"During the 20th century, rubber became so important that there were various attempts to develop a synthetic version.","words":[["During",272.91,273.63],["the",273.63,273.83],["20th",273.83,274.31],["century,",274.31,274.65],["rubber",275.11,275.23],["became",275.23,275.63],["so",275.63,275.91],["important",275.91,276.37],["that",276.37,276.85],["there",276.85,276.99],["were",276.99,277.11],["various",277.11,277.49],["attempts",277.49,277.95],["to",277.95,278.23],["develop",278.23,278.63],["a",278.63,278.83],["synthetic",278.83,279.17],["version.",279.17,279.79]]},{"s